            <source srcset=\"/uploads/antonio-narino.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/antonio-narino.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Pictorial portrait of Antonio Nariño in full-dress military uniform, with a red coat embroidered in gold\"\n                width=\"408\"\n                height=\"490\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <div style=\"text-align:center; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; font-style:italic;\">\n            <span style=\"display:block;\">Antonio Nariño, the Precursor</span>\n            <span style=\"display:block;\">Original watercolor at the Jockey Club, Bogotá, Colombia</span>\n          </div>\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Enlarged portrait\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"antonio-narino\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Close\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out disabled=\"true\" aria-label=\"Zoom out\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&minus;</button>\n                <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button disabled=\"false\" data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; touch-action:none;\">\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/antonio-narino.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img data-zoom-image\n                    src=\"/uploads/antonio-narino.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Retrato de Antonio Nariño, enlarged view\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; object-fit:contain; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n              <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Birth</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">April 9, 1765 &mdash; Santafé de Bogotá, New Kingdom of Granada</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Death</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">December 13, 1823 &mdash; Villa de Leyva, New Granada</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Profession</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Military, Politician and Editor</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Key Role</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Precursor of New Granadan independence; president of the State of Cundinamarca (1811&ndash;1813) and vice president of Gran Colombia (1821)</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">1. Forbidden translation</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\">Merchant and enlightened official from Santafé de Bogotá, Antonio Nariño became famous in 1794 by clandestinely translating and printing the<strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Declaration of the Rights of Man and Citizen</strong>, a French revolutionary text banned by the Spanish Crown.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">The act cost him a trial for sedition, the confiscation of his assets and a sentence of ten years in prison in Africa, from which he escaped during his transfer to Spain, beginning years of escape and hiding through Europe and America.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">2. Return and Leadership at Independence</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\">Nariño returned to New Granada in 1797 and voluntarily surrendered to the authorities, spending several more years in prison. Released after the events of July 20, 1810, he became a central figure in the first republic: he was elected president of the<strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">State of Cundinamarca</strong>(1811&ndash;1813) and firmly defended the centralist model against the federalists of the United Provinces.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">He personally led the failed Southern Campaign in 1813&ndash;1814 to liberate Pasto and Quito, being captured by the royalists and sent prisoner to Spain, where he remained until 1820.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">3. Final Years and Vice-Presidency</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\">Released after the constitutional restoration in Spain, he returned to New Granada already in the midst of the definitive war of independence. In 1821 he was appointed interim vice president of Gran Colombia by the Congress of Cúcuta, although his health, deteriorated by years of imprisonment, prevented him from holding office for long.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">He retired to Villa de Leyva, where he died in 1823, already recognized during his lifetime as one of the ideological fathers of Spanish American independence.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">4. Numismatic Legacy</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">Nariño's portrait figures prominently in the series of<a href=\"/en/collection/colombia/banco-de-la-republica-10-pesos-oro/\">Ten Pesos Gold</a>of El Banco de la República (issues of 1949, 1953, 1960 and 1961), in circulation during a good part of the 20th century, and also in the<a href=\"/en/collection/colombia/banco-de-la-republica-half-peso-oro-specimen/\">1948 Medio Peso Oro specimen</a>&mdash;enduring tribute to his role as one of the first intellectual martyrs of American independence.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notes</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">Biography based on the Encyclopedia of the Bank of the Republic (enciclopedia.banrepcultural.org) and standard historical sources on the independence of New Granada.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:6px 0 0;\">Portrait: watercolor of Antonio Nariño, original held at the Jockey Club, Bogotá, Colombia.</p>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "Antonio Nariño",
      "eyebrow": "Historical Profile · El Precursor"
    }
  }
